  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "# How to use\n- Draw with the tools on the left; \\textbf{Plots} and \\textbf{Blocks} hold graphs, circuits and more.\n- Double-click to edit, right-click for more. Maths goes between \\$ signs.\n- In Classic, switch between \\textbf{Document} and \\textbf{Diagram} at the top, or double-click a diagram.\n- \\textbf{Code} gives TikZ, \\textbf{LaTeX} the whole document, \\textbf{Export} a picture or PDF."
  }
